          "type": "text",
          "text": "A school map has lost its scale, but the 900 m boundary fence is drawn 6 cm long. The path to the canteen measures 10 cm on the same map. Find the real length of the path in metres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
